# kflux: Flux resources, failing first, with events
Output docs/kflux.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 640
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Hide
Type `export KUBECONFIG="$DEMO_EUW" && clear`
Enter
Show
Type "kflux"
Enter
Sleep 7s
Down
Sleep 1500ms
Up
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
